1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,541
Meet Lanie, your phone rental assistant. Track rental time, customer

2
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:07,908
payments, and available phones. Here is how to use it.

3
00:00:08,508 --> 00:00:13,070
Enter your private family code. Up to five devices can use the same counter.

4
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:16,492
Keep the code private and stay connected to the internet.

5
00:00:17,092 --> 00:00:21,529
Your dashboard shows collections for today, yesterday, this week, last week,

6
00:00:21,529 --> 00:00:25,325
and this month. Dates use Philippine time. Weeks start on Monday.

7
00:00:25,925 --> 00:00:30,479
Tap Add client, enter the customer’s name, and tap Save client. Save each

8
00:00:30,479 --> 00:00:34,408
customer once. Their name stays in your list for future visits.

9
00:00:35,008 --> 00:00:39,183
Tap Start rental and choose the customer from your saved clients. Use the

10
00:00:39,183 --> 00:00:41,242
search field to find a name quickly.

11
00:00:41,842 --> 00:00:46,904
Select an available phone and the rental duration. One hour costs ten pesos.

12
00:00:46,904 --> 00:00:51,367
Thirty minutes costs five pesos. You can also enter custom minutes.

13
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:56,550
Choose Paid now only after receiving the money. Choose Pay later if the

14
00:00:56,550 --> 00:01:00,617
customer has not paid. Unpaid balances are not collected sales.

15
00:01:01,217 --> 00:01:05,815
Check the name, phone, duration, and payment. Then tap Start timer. The

16
00:01:05,815 --> 00:01:09,700
rental card shows the remaining time and any unpaid balance.

17
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:15,039
To add time, tap Extend. Choose the extra minutes and whether they are paid.

18
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:17,783
Previously paid time is never charged again.

19
00:01:18,383 --> 00:01:22,986
Tap Pause and save time. This stops the countdown and releases the phone, so

20
00:01:22,986 --> 00:01:24,742
another customer can rent it.

21
00:01:25,342 --> 00:01:29,773
Maria’s remaining forty five minutes stay saved under her name. Saved time

22
00:01:29,773 --> 00:01:33,367
does not run down while paused, even when the app is closed.

23
00:01:33,967 --> 00:01:38,594
When Maria returns, open Clients and search for her name. Tap Resume time.

24
00:01:38,594 --> 00:01:41,908
Her saved time and previous payments are still there.

25
00:01:42,508 --> 00:01:46,848
Choose an available phone, then tap Resume timer. You can use a different

26
00:01:46,848 --> 00:01:50,533
phone. The remaining paid time resumes without another charge.

27
00:01:51,133 --> 00:01:55,635
Tap Transfer phone and choose a replacement. The remaining time and payment

28
00:01:55,635 --> 00:01:59,117
records stay the same. Pause first if you need setup time.

29
00:01:59,717 --> 00:02:04,451
Mark the old phone Charging or Needs service. It cannot be rented again until

30
00:02:04,451 --> 00:02:07,033
you open My phones and tap Mark available.

31
00:02:07,633 --> 00:02:12,665
On the device that should ring, turn Sound alarms here on. Tap Test sound and

32
00:02:12,665 --> 00:02:16,325
check the volume. Only one device handles rental alarms.

33
00:02:16,925 --> 00:02:21,692
On an iPhone or iPad website, keep the screen awake. In the Android app,

34
00:02:21,692 --> 00:02:26,658
allow notifications and Alarms and reminders. Test the alarm on your phone.

35
00:02:27,258 --> 00:02:31,520
Up to five devices share live updates while online. To move alarm

36
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:36,437
responsibility, open and reconnect the previous alarm device so it can stop

37
00:02:36,437 --> 00:02:37,158
its alerts.

38
00:02:37,758 --> 00:02:42,536
Tap End rental and check the balance. Collect any remaining payment, or leave

39
00:02:42,536 --> 00:02:45,825
it unpaid. Do not charge again for time already paid.

40
00:02:46,425 --> 00:02:51,086
Use Reports and Collections to review payments, refunds, and corrections.

41
00:02:51,086 --> 00:02:56,003
Unpaid balances stay separate. With Lanie, keep rental time and money easy to

42
00:02:56,003 --> 00:02:56,450
follow.
